>1) How do you get a Ring of Conflict to work?? I have (P)ut one on
>in several different games, and still the monsters did not attack each
>other. Is there something special that I have to do??

What you're doing is correct but the monsters must be next to each
other for the ring to work.  If they are even one square apart they
won't fight.

>2) What exactly is a Treasure Zoo? I know about the messages that let
>you know there is one on the level, but I have yet to find one.
>   So what are they, and how do I find them?

A Treasure Zoo is just a room like any other but it is crammed from wall
to wall with monsters.  Each monster will be standing on some gold,
hence the name.  One hint, if you aren't stealthy the monsters will hear
you, wake up, and come out to kick your ass!

>3) After reading an unidentified scroll I recieved the following message
>  "Your hands begin to glow red" I haven't been able to figure out this
>one yet??

That is a confuse monster scroll, the next monster you hit will become
confused.

